#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:5 92b27444e39843e4b7891fdb0deca8b5
msgid "APJ Tools for Custom Parameter Defaults"
msgstr "用于自定义参数默认值的 APJ 工具"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:7 9811004a3c9140e79337e6b16700efc9
msgid ""
"this capability has been removed as of ArduPilot version 4.5 and later. See "
"instead :ref:`common-oem-customizations`."
msgstr "此功能自 ArduPilot 4.5 版本起已移除。请改参阅 :ref:`common-oem-customizations`。"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:9 8ce6e5d504f84d10bf09a830caaee4b5
msgid ""
"`APJ Tools "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/scripts/apj_tool.py>`__"
" is a command-line `Python <https://www.python.org/downloads/>`__ program "
"which can be used to add custom default parameter values to a pre-built "
"ArduPilot firmware.  It can also mark these parameters as read-only to avoid"
" users accidentally overwriting them.  This can help companies reduce the "
"time required to set up many identical vehicles."
msgstr ""
"`APJ 工具 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/scripts/apj_tool.py>`__"
" 是一个命令行 `Python <https://www.python.org/downloads/>`__ 程序，可用于向预构建的 ArduPilot"
" 固件添加自定义默认参数值。它还可以将这些参数标记为只读，以防止用户意外覆盖。这有助于公司减少配置多台相同飞行器所需的时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:11 13f6e8e05605450e8c0ee1f02efbc2f1
msgid ""
"Additional customization options are possible by creating a new build target"
" for a specific vehicle. :ref:`OEM Customization<common-oem-customizations>`"
msgstr "通过为特定飞行器创建新的构建目标，可以实现更多自定义选项。:ref:`OEM 定制<common-oem-customizations>`"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:14 12b5bddb8eb744959c23c942ec65dde6
msgid "How to Install APJ Tools"
msgstr "如何安装 APJ Tools"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:16 ed861bcaafa94c84975f1b572ca47276
msgid ""
"`Download and Install Python <https://www.python.org/downloads/>`__ if not "
"already installed on your machine"
msgstr "如果尚未安装，请 `下载并安装 Python <https://www.python.org/downloads/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:17 c444a658b4ab4c52b0753e88e2639b2a
msgid ""
"Use a web browser to open `APJ Tools "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/master/Tools/scripts/apj_tool.py>`__"
" in the ArduPilot GitHub repository and then right-mouse-button click and "
"save to a file on your PC"
msgstr ""
"使用浏览器打开 ArduPilot GitHub 仓库中的 `APJ Tools "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/master/Tools/scripts/apj_tool.py>`__，然后鼠标右键单击并保存到计算机上的文件"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:20 4e728144fb65423d92d64924e872bbc5
msgid "How to update the Defaults"
msgstr "如何更新默认值"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:22 48957e2c5fdb465cb251aa02f18fdedc
msgid ""
"Find and download the ArduPilot firmware you wish to customize from "
"`firmware.ardupilot.org <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__.  For example, "
"the stable version of ArduPilot Copter for the Hex Cube Black is the "
"\"arducopter.apj\" file found at "
"`firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/stable/CubeBlack/ "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/stable/CubeBlack>`__."
msgstr ""
"从 `firmware.ardupilot.org <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__ 查找并下载您要定制的 "
"ArduPilot 固件。例如，适用于 Hex Cube Black 的 ArduPilot Copter 稳定版是位于 "
"`firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/stable/CubeBlack/ "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/stable/CubeBlack>`__ 的 "
"「arducopter.apj」 文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:23 814f2873b3f84cf79feebc141fb13865
msgid ""
"Place the above .apj file in the same directory as the apj_tool.py file"
msgstr "将上述 .apj 文件放置于与 apj_tool.py 文件相同的目录中"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:24 c93c7a0b6f644405a4303ef0c37dbaee
msgid ""
"Use a text editor to create a parameters file (maybe called \"param-"
"defaults.parm\") of this format"
msgstr "使用文本编辑器创建此格式的参数文件（可命名为 「param-defaults.parm」）"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:32 65a8ad8b5d2e48afae3284d01fbb3998
msgid "Embed the parameter defaults in the .apj firmware with this command"
msgstr "使用此命令将参数默认值嵌入 .apj 固件"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:38 144cb0e67dd649be83bc12fb536c910d
msgid "Check the defaults have been applied correctly with this command"
msgstr "使用此命令验证默认值是否已正确应用"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:44 85d6c6e95da341c49bbe4f264699a2cd
msgid ""
"Load the modified .apj file to your vehicle and check the defaults have "
"worked correctly"
msgstr "将修改后的 .apj 文件加载到飞行器，并验证默认值是否正常生效"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:47 71a9bdb5394a435980fb28e47ce9b880
msgid "Additional Info"
msgstr "附加信息"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:49 e390c88bda7a43b3bbe9e05d644b3bb2
msgid "APJ Tool's help can be displayed using this command"
msgstr "可使用此命令显示 APJ Tool 的帮助信息"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:55 1c8e0162654c45e7b99b9500e349c06e
msgid ""
"The parameters will be the new default values only if the user has not "
"modified them"
msgstr "仅当用户未修改参数时，这些参数才会采用新的默认值"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:56 0c3e7fc85f6b41f9bb61f29251fee7bc
msgid ""
"If all parameters are reset to their defaults, they will return to the "
"values specified in the file"
msgstr "如果将所有参数重置为默认值，它们将恢复为文件中指定的值"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:57 8b78c366e8b54a0398c92ab400eae813
msgid ""
"The @READONLY modifier will stop users from modifying the parameter as long "
"as they use this particular firmware.  The users can get around this though "
"if they go to the extra effort of loading the standard ArduPilot firmware to"
" the autopilot"
msgstr ""
"@READONLY 修饰符将阻止用户修改参数，只要他们使用该特定固件。但用户可以通过额外操作将标准 ArduPilot 固件加载到飞控来绕过此限制"

#: ../../source/docs/apjtools-intro.rst:58 5e3d30e48bd642bca5ae8885cb09723b
msgid ""
"The new parameter default file can be a maximum of 8k including comments"
msgstr "新参数默认值文件（含注释）最大不超过 8k"
